 height=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\"/></figure><div class=\"cat-slider__info\"><p class=\"cat-slider__name\">Fire or Safety Audit</p></div></a></li><li id=\"6826746248\" class=\"cat-slider__card\"><a href=\"products.html#6826746248\"><figure class=\"cat-slider__figure\"><img src=\"https://3.imimg.com/data3/KR/VY/MY-9753159/testing-and-commissioning-250x250.jpg\" alt=\"Testing and Commissioning\" width=\"184\" height=\"184\" loading=\"lazy\"/></figure><div class=\"cat-slider__info\"><p class=\"cat-slider__name\">Testing and Commissioning</p></div></a></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-slider__arrow cat-slider__arrow--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous\" hidden=\"\">‹</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cat-slider__arrow cat-slider__arrow--next\" aria-label=\"Next\">›</button></div></section><section class=\"aboutus-intro\"><h2 class=\"aboutus-heading\">Oxiona Energy Solutions India Pvt. Ltd.</h2><div class=\"aboutus-desc\">We are empanelled energy auditing consultancy firm, delivering long term energy conservation solutions to our customers through innovative systems, strategies &amp; concepts.We are an energy audit company with experienced consultants (BEE certified energy auditors) supported by technically qualified staff for measurements. We not only give suggestions for energy saving but also support for energy management &amp; post audit implementation of saving proposals. Schemes suggested for energy saving &amp; energy efficiency improvement are backed up with required technical specifications &amp; budgetary estimate of investment.</div></section><section class=\"album-section card\" aria-label=\"Company Album\"><h2 class=\"album-section__heading\">Company Album</h2><div class=\"album-section__viewport\" data-album-images=\"[{&quot;display&quot;:&quot;https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-1000x1000.png&quot;,&quot;full&quot;:&quot;https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-1000x1000.png&quot;,&quot;bimg&quot;:&quot;https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-1000x1000.png&quot;,&quot;thumb&quot;:&quot;https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-125x125.png&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Why Us?&quot;}]\"><div class=\"album-section__track\" role=\"list\"><figure class=\"album-section__slide\" role=\"listitem\" data-index=\"0\"><img src=\"https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-1000x1000.png\" width=\"184\" height=\"184\" alt=\"Why Us?\" loading=\"lazy\"/></figure></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"album-section__arrow album-section__arrow--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous\" hidden=\"\">‹</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"album-section__arrow album-section__arrow--next\" aria-label=\"Next\">›</button></div></section><div class=\"extended-sections\"><article class=\"profile-section\"><h2>Why Us?</h2><div class=\"profile-section__body\"><div class=\"profile-section__media\" data-profile-images=\"[{&quot;full&quot;:&quot;https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-1000x1000.png&quot;,&quot;bimg&quot;:&quot;https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-1000x1000.png&quot;,&quot;thumb&quot;:&quot;https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-1000x1000.png&quot;}]\"><figure class=\"profile-section__main-img\"><img src=\"https://3.imimg.com/data3/WT/SF/MY-9753159/fu-1000x1000.png\" alt=\"Why Us?\" width=\"498\" height=\"498\" loading=\"lazy\"/></figure></div><div class=\"profile-section__content\"><div class=\"profile-section__desc profile-section__desc--truncated\">Energy can be defined as the capacity to do work. Since India is a developing country we need more energy for continuous progress. While efforts are being made to improve availability of various energy sources, there is still a continuing gap between demand and supply of energy. Conservation and efficient utilization of energy resources play a vital role in narrowing the gap between demand and supply of energy. Improving energy efficiency is probably the most economical way of narrowing the gap.Considering the vast potential of energy savings and benefits of energy efficiency, the Government of India has enacted the Energy Conservation Act, 2001 (52 of 2001). The Act provides for the legal framework, institutional arrangement and a regulatory mechanism at the Central and State level to embark upon energy efficiency drive in the country.We are here to suggest /implement methods for reduction of energy cost &amp; consumption, so that profitability of our corporate sector increases &amp; core energy resources do not get depleted in near future to come.</div><a href=\"why-us.html\" class=\"profile-section__read-more\">+ Read More</a></div></div></article></div><section class=\"factsheet-table\" aria-label=\"Factsheet\"><h2 class=\"factsheet-table__heading\">Factsheet</h2><div class=\"factsheet-table__section\"><h3 class=\"factsheet-table__title\">Basic Information</h3><dl class=\"factsheet-table__list\"><div class=\"factsheet-table__row\"><dt class=\"factsheet-table__label\">Nature of Business</dt><dd class=\"factsheet-table__value\"><span>Service Provider</span></dd></div><div class=\"factsheet-table__row\"><dt class=\"factsheet-table__label\">Legal Status of Firm</dt><dd class=\"factsheet-table__value\"><span>Limited Company (Ltd./Pvt.Ltd.)</span></dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"factsheet-table__section\"><h3 class=\"factsheet-table__title\">Statutory Profile</h3><dl class=\"factsheet-table__list\"><div class=\"factsheet-table__row\"><dt class=\"factsheet-table__label\">CIN No.</dt><dd class=\"factsheet-table__value\"><span>U74120MH****PTC****29</span></dd></div></dl></div></section></div></main></div><div class=\"fcp-ad-slot\" id=\"Below_Related_Products\" aria-label=\"Advertisement\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center\" data-ad-layout=\"in-article\" data-ad-format=\"fluid\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-0673059417528889\" data-ad-slot=\"8501342440\"></ins></div><footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer__banner\"><h2 class=\"footer__banner-title\">Get in touch with us<